      <source>SR5</source>
      <page>292</page>
      <extra />
      <notes>This spell creates a glowing field of magical energy around the subject that protects against Physical Damage. It provides Armor equal to the hits scored and is cumulative with other armor. It is not included in any calculations to determine armor encumbrance (see Armor and Encumbrance, p. 169).</notes>
      <notesColor>#400080</notesColor>
