          <extra />
          <stolen>False</stolen>
          <notes>DRAG HANDLE
A relatively simple modification, the drag handle is a strap anchored to the back of an armored jacket, vest, or suit that allows an injured character to be dragged or carried with greater ease. The Drag Handle adds +2 dice to Lifting and Carrying Tests (p. 139, SR4A, or p. 152, SR5) to move the character.</notes>
          <notesColor>Chocolate</notesColor>
          <discountedcost>False</discountedcost>
          <sortorder>0</sortorder>
        </armormod>
      </armormods>
      <bonus />
      <wirelessbonus />
      <location />
      <notes>Armor clothing: Lightweight ballistic fiber weave makes these garments almost impossible to detect as armor. It doesn’t provide as much protection as real ar- mor, but it’s available in a wide variety of styles.</notes>
      <notesColor>Chocolate</notesColor>
      <discountedcost>False</discountedcost>
      <sortorder>0</sortorder>
    </armor>
