      <location />
      <notes>Medkit: The medkit includes drug supplies, bandages, tools, and a (talkative) doctor expert system that can ad- vise the user on techniques to handle most typical medical emergencies (including fractures, gunshot wounds, chem- ical wounds, and poisoning, as well as offering advice for the treating of shock, handling blood loss, and of course performing resuscitations). Add the medkit’s rating to your limit on First Aid tests. A medkit of Rating 3 or lower fits in a pocket; at Rating 4+ it’s a handheld case. The medkit needs to be restocked after every (Rating) uses.</notes>
      <notesColor>Chocolate</notesColor>
